THE CENSUS, sorted by internal acceleration.  ISOLATED = g_int > g_ext (the RAR's regime);
SATURATED = g_int < g_ext (the external-field regime, where the boost is nu(e)[1+L/3] and does NOT
depend on g_int at all -- the corner the BTFR cannot reach).
